reference[19]: Install or upgrade a trusted dibs binary built for the remote OS/architecture.,The remote checks --version before atomic replacement; mismatches retain the,"existing binary. Machine config requires host, user, absolute workdir and agent",paths; optional port and identity_file. SSH config aliases are supported.,"No source, worktree, environment, credentials, or build tools are synchronized.","Examples:","  GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64 go build -o /tmp/dibs-linux .","  dibs machine install lenovo --file /tmp/dibs-linux","Output: --axi for agents, --json for scripts (mutually exclusive).","Default: human on terminals; AXI for pipes or DIBS_AXI=1.","Lease commands: --full restores complete AXI records/text; JSON is always complete.","","Exit codes: 0 success (including no-ops), 1 operation failed, 2 invalid usage.","dibs job: child's exit code on completion; 124 deadline killed child;",75 (EX_TEMPFAIL) no slot within wait. Dibs's own 1/2 apply only when no child,was started. Signal termination returns 128 + signal number. Helper/wait,failures after start use 125/126 and diagnostics on stderr.,76 is SSH transport/protocol failure with unknown remote result (stderr).,Child exit 255 is preserved and is not confused with SSH failure.
usage: "dibs machine install <name> --file <binary> [--json]"
